[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on the ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>1. Slacken the moving tensioner bolts (1a) so as to release the\ntension, then remove the alternator/water pump drive belt (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021264.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the alternator/water pump drive belt\non its drive pulleys.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584376\">1092B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]